    slug: 'msme-registration-online-2026-benefits-process-documents',
    title: 'MSME Registration Online 2026: Benefits, Process, and Documents Required',
    description: 'Complete guide to MSME Udyam registration in 2026 — eligibility criteria, step-by-step online process, documents required, benefits including priority lending, tax advantages under Section 43B(h), and government scheme access.',
