      'For startups under the Employees Pension Scheme (EPS), remember that the employer PF contribution of 12% is split: 8.33% goes to EPS (capped at ₹15,000 wage ceiling) and 3.67% goes to EPF. This split is automatic through the EPFO portal, but understanding it helps reconcile your contributions with the employee passbook balance.',
